   "t": 0,
   "text": "Wondering which of your players actually scan? This game finds them for you.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "hook"
  },
  {
   "t": 0,
   "text": "Five cone gates scattered across the area, with four v four between them.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "picture"
  },
  {
   "t": 1.5,
   "text": "Only one gate is alive at a time, and you point at it silently.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
   "t": 9.24,
   "text": "Spot the pointing, play to the live gate, and it moves once somebody scores.",
   "hold": 2.5,
   "beat": "action"
  },
  {
